<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Bloch half year pre-tax up 29.2 percent.</title>
<headline>Bloch half year pre-tax up 29.2 percent.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended December 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     3.4	   vs 2.6</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 3.4	   vs 2.5</p>
<p>    Royalties received    1.01	  vs 0.85</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   1.02	  vs 0.86</p>
<p>    Tax			 0.39	  vs 0.36</p>
<p>Div payable February 21</p>
<p>on register February 7</p>
<p>Full name: Bloch Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Bloch earns most of its revenue from royalties paid for the use of the Bloch trademarks by trading companies in the Bloch Supermarkets group which operates 16 stores in the Western and Eastern Cape regions.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
